      "rationale": "The end-to-end calibration pipeline is genuinely novel in the space, but the Seshadri et al. 'minimal intervention' (behavioral constraint prompting that limits politeness to target rates) already demonstrates partial mitigation without training — and DemoCalib includes no baseline that directly encodes target behavioral rates into the system prompt. Without this comparison, the DPO contribution cannot be clearly distinguished from simple behavioral prompting."
